WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.102
"My Lady," the mirror said.

2
00:00:07.103 --> 00:00:12.291
"Snow White is the most beautiful woman in the kingdom."

3
00:00:12.292 --> 00:00:14.718
The queen gritted her teeth.

4
00:00:14.719 --> 00:00:22.722
"Oh no! She's still alive!"

5
00:00:22.723 --> 00:00:32.479
The next morning the dwarfs left for the mines.

6
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.344
Dar waved good-bye to Snow White.

7
00:00:35.345 --> 00:00:38.134
"Remember," he called.

8
00:00:38.135 --> 00:00:46.539
"Don't let anyone in!"

9
00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:50.449
Snow White was washing dishes.

10
00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:54.065
"Clothes for sale!" a voice called.

11
00:00:54.066 --> 00:00:58.768
"Lovely, beautiful clothes!"

12
00:00:58.769 --> 00:01:05.410
