13
00:01:05.411 --> 00:01:09.119
An old woman was walking by.

14
00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:16.528
She pulled a small wagon loaded with chests.

15
00:01:16.529 --> 00:01:19.609
"Hello, miss!" the woman said.

16
00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:27.501
"Would you like to buy something?"

17
00:01:27.502 --> 00:01:31.011
Snow White remembered Dar's warning.

18
00:01:31.012 --> 00:01:35.541
"No, thank you," she said.

19
00:01:35.542 --> 00:01:39.565
The woman pulled a fancy coat out of a chest. She

20
00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:42.044
stepped toward the house. "This

21
00:01:42.045 --> 00:01:46.047
coat matches your hair," she said. Snow

22
00:01:46.048 --> 00:01:49.407
White gazed at the beautiful coat. The

23
00:01:49.408 --> 00:01:51.691
woman stepped closer. "Just

24
00:01:51.692 --> 00:01:54.527
try it on," she said. "There's

25
00:01:54.528 --> 00:01:57.934
no harm in that." Snow

26
00:01:57.935 --> 00:02:08.055
White bit her lip. "Well . . . Okay." The

27
00:02:08.056 --> 00:02:10.357
woman smiled. She

28
00:02:10.358 --> 00:02:12.908
held up the coat for Snow White. Snow

29
00:02:12.909 --> 00:02:15.297
White put one arm through. She

30
00:02:15.298 --> 00:02:22.102
put her other arm through. Suddenly

31
00:02:22.103 --> 00:02:24.342
the coat grew tight. It

32
00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:26.753
squeezed her entire body. "Ahh!"

33
